# liteDS-v2 input script - hold A for the whole run.
#
# Used with the savestate-based in-race benchmark: load the race-start savestate
# (savestates/shrek-race.mln, dumped at frame F=1600 of shrek-race.script) and
# hold A (accelerate) from frame 0 so the kart drives during the measured window.
# This reproduces shrek-race.script's in-race workload without re-running menus.
0 A
